{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Built<i> in 5 Minutes</i>, solo-multiplayer game gives you just <strong>five minutes</strong> to design and shape your own map\u00a0 then swap roles with your friends to see if they can survive and complete the world you\u2019ve created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5-Minute Building Challenge</strong> \u2013 Every round begins with a countdown. You have only 5 minutes to construct a playable map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Creativity</strong> \u2013 Use a variety of tools and objects to design unique challenges, environments, and obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op &amp; Competitive Play</strong> \u2013 Challenge your friends in local or online multiplayer. Take turns building and playing each other\u2019s creations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Sharing</strong> \u2013 Upload your maps and explore what other players have made, all built under the same 5-minute rule.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong> \u2013 No two maps are the same. Every session brings new ideas, new challenges, and unexpected fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is built in 5 minutes with Ai.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character are generated with Ai.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animation are\u00a0generated with Ai.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >99% of the code is written with Ai.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Let\u2019s see who spends their 5 minutes the best.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4028670?t=1763568017","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4028670?t=1763568017","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028670/acd542